      970         shar-buf_ord-cons.PS FORMAT "X(250)"
      971       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 98 BY 15.
      972   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      973        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1.75
      974        b-sel AT ROW 1 COL 13.75
      975        b-rep AT ROW 1 COL 25.75
      976        b-sch AT ROW 1 COL 37.75
      977        b-za AT ROW 1 COL 49.75
