      991        sch-code AT ROW 22 COL 15 COLON-ALIGNED
      992        sch-date AT ROW 22 COL 35.88 COLON-ALIGNED
      993        sch-num AT ROW 22 COL 57.63 COLON-ALIGNED
      994       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      995            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      996            TITLE "Совокупнные заявки"
      997            CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
      998   ASSIGN
      999          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     1000          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     1001   ASSIGN
     1002          b-print:POPUP-MENU IN FRAME Dialog-Frame       = MENU POPUP-MENU-b-print:HANDLE.
     1003   ASSIGN
     1004          EDITOR_PS:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
     1005   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
